cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, cite it as below."
title: "entities-interaction-sim"
abstract: >-
  A small Godot world that simulates room-scale VR interaction mechanics behind the
  same actions a remote pilot sends, and writes frames with keypoint labels that are
  true by construction.
authors:
